00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:50.850
It's warm because there's
heat from the Earth's magma

00:01:50.850 --> 00:01:53.193
that is coming up, and making it warm.

00:01:55.390 --> 00:01:58.640
The word Saturday, Laugardag in Icelandic

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:01.700
means pool day or hot spring day.

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:03.800
It's literally a part of their language.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:05.750
