00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.270
Okay so remember that when
you go into hot water,

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:58.860
your body kind of freaks out

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:00.660
and it uses all of these little tubes

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:03.740
in the muscles in your arteries and veins.

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:06.500
To pump blood out to your extremities,

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.640
to keep your heart cold.

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:10.830
When you go into cold water,
the exact opposite happens.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:12.270
Your body still freaks out.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:15.810
It's like we're going to die
because we are now freezing.

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.870
It prepares to save the most
important parts of your body.

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:20.160
It's like, don't care about the arms

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.010
at this point, we don't
care about the toes.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:24.270
Get the blood out of all of those places,

00:10:24.270 --> 00:10:25.770
bring them back to the heart and the brain

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:29.200
and the liver and the lungs
keep those alive and warm.

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:31.960
So now all of your little
tubes are flexing and pulsing

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:34.390
and pushing all of this blood

00:10:34.390 --> 00:10:37.220
back to the center of your body.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:40.110
And here's the deal,
your veins and arteries,

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:43.120
don't get to do this very often.

00:10:43.120 --> 00:10:44.380
Especially in our modern age where

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:45.980
we're like cozy all the time.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.450
They don't have a lot of practice

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.970
pushing blood out to the extremities

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.660
when everything's hot and then

00:10:51.660 --> 00:10:54.850
pushing it all back to the
heart when everything is cold.

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:56.410
This is sort of like lifting weights

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:58.150
for your cardiovascular system.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.380
You're giving your circulation system

00:11:00.380 --> 00:11:02.730
a chance to work out in a way

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:04.950
that it never really has the opportunity

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:06.300
to do when you're like sitting around

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:08.350
cozy all the time in
your nice warm clothes

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.800
and nice warm house.

00:11:09.800 --> 00:11:12.383
(upbeat music)

